00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:04,840
LISTENING, READING, AND SPEAKING

2
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:07,420
5.

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:11,060
Now read more about Freddy's life.

4
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:14,900
Freddy the Frog Part 2

5
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:22,280
Not long after Freddy and the band became famous, they visited Britain on a brief tour.

6
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:28,000
Fans showed their devotion by waiting for hours to get tickets

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,160
for their concerts.

8
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:33,560
Freddy was now quite confident when he went into a concert hall.

9
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:37,700
He enjoyed singing and all the congratulations afterwards!

10
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:53,520
It felt very strange.

11
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,860
Everybody was asking when they could see Freddy and his band again.

12
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:07,260
They were truly stars.

13
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:10,500
Then things went wrong.

14
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,600
Freddy and his band could not go out anywhere without being followed.

15
00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:22,260
Even when they wore sunglasses or beards people recognized them.

16
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:25,720
Fans found them even when they went into the toilet.

17
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:29,500
They tried to hide in the reading rooms of libraries,

18
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,400
but it was useless.

19
00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:33,980
Someone was always there!

20
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:39,760
Their personal life was regularly discussed by people who did not know them

21
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:42,620
but talked as if they were close friends.

22
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:46,260
At last feeling very upset and sensitive,

23
00:01:46,820 --> 00:01:50,680
Freddy and his band realized that they must leave the country

24
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:53,680
before it became too painful for them.

25
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:57,480
So they left Britain, to which they were never to return,

26
00:01:58,020 --> 00:01:59,460
and went back to the lake.
